---
import SectionInfo from "../../components/SectionInfo.astro";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import suppliers from "../../json/suppliers.json";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { LinkServices } from "../../data/LinkServicesRoffing";
import BuutonMovil from "../../components/ButtonMovil.astro";
import MoreServices from "../../components/moreServices.astro";
import RelationServices from "../../components/relationServices.astro";
import TrustOur from "../../components/trustOur.astro";
import CertificatesAffiliations from "../../components/CertificatesAffiliations.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Metal Roofing in Albany | Durable Stone-Coated Steel Roofs | Nova Solutions"
  description="Upgrade your home with long-lasting stone-coated metal roofing in Albany. Nova Solutions offers expert installation, top-quality materials, and energy-efficient protection built to withstand harsh weather. Get a free inspection today!"
/>
<BuutonMovil class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-50" />
<div class="mt-[172px] md:mt-[95px]">
  <SectionInfo heading={"Metal Roofing"} sliders={suppliers} />
</div>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16">
  <div class="breadcrumb text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-center">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary">Home</a>
    <iconify-icon
      icon="mingcute:arrows-right-line"
      class="mx-2 text-gray-400 text-lg"></iconify-icon>

    <a href="/Roofing" class="hover:text-primary">Roofing</a>
    <iconify-icon
      icon="mingcute:arrows-right-line"
      class="mx-2 text-gray-400 text-lg"></iconify-icon>
    <span class="font-semibold text-black">Metal Roofing</span>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 items-center lg:items-start">
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-black text-center lg:text-left mt-10">
        Metal Roofing in Albany – Built to Last, Designed to Impress
      </h1>
      <p class="text-black leading-relaxed text-justify">
        Tired of dealing with endless roof repairs? With a <strong
          >metal roof installed by Nova Solutions</strong
        >, you can enjoy long-term peace of mind and reliable protection for
        decades. Our <strong>stone-coated metal roofing systems</strong> combine
        timeless beauty with the unmatched strength of steel-core shingles—engineered
        to be the most durable part of your home. Designed to resist rust, wind,
        hail, and fire, our metal roofs are low maintenance and backed by industry-leading
        warranties.
        <br /><br />
        At <strong>Nova Solutions</strong>, we’re not just installers—we’re
        certified experts with specialized training and years of experience in <strong
          >Albany metal roof installations</strong
        >. From structural support to flawless shingle alignment, we follow
        precise methods to maximize the lifespan and performance of your new
        roof. Don’t just take our word for it—check out what your neighbors are
        saying in our 5-star reviews!
      </p>
    </div>
    <section class="flex-1 text-primary">
      <CertificatesAffiliations />
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<section
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"
>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black text-center lg:text-left">
      Trusted Metal Roofing Installers in Albany
    </h2>
    <p class="text-black leading-relaxed text-justify">
      A long-lasting metal roof starts with two critical elements: <strong
        >premium materials</strong
      > and <strong>expert installation</strong>. At Nova Solutions, we use only
      high-quality <strong>stone-coated steel shingles</strong> that combine the
      elegance of traditional roofing styles with unbeatable strength and impact
      resistance. Whether you prefer a classic or modern look, our metal shingles
      are built to protect your home from the toughest weather Albany has to offer.
      <br /><br />
      Equally important is having a team of certified professionals who understand
      the complexities of <strong>metal roof installation</strong>. Our skilled
      installers at Nova Solutions are trained to meet the highest industry
      standards—ensuring a roof that’s not only stylish, but structurally sound
      and built to last for decades.
    </p>
  </div>
  <img
    src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyxelzh/image/upload/v1747003748/20230526_115959_wjngnd.jpg"
    alt="Roofing Installation"
    class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-lg mx-auto h-85"
  />
</section>

<!-- Sección 2: Imagen a la izquierda + texto -->
<section
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"
>
  <img
    src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyxelzh/image/upload/v1745296100/GAF-Layer-lock-Dynamic-Restoration_hodwla.jpg"
    alt="Certified Roofing Process"
    class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-md mx-auto order-1 md:order-none"
  />
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black text-center lg:text-left">
        Why Albany Homeowners Choose Nova Solutions for Metal Roofing
      </h2>
      <p class="text-black leading-relaxed text-justify mt-2">
        At Nova Solutions, we install <strong>stone-coated metal roofs</strong> that
        deliver powerful benefits designed to withstand Albany’s unpredictable weather—while
        boosting your home’s comfort, safety, and style.
      </p>
      <ul
        class="list-disc list-inside text-black leading-relaxed mt-4 space-y-2"
      >
        <li>
          <strong>Energy Efficiency:</strong> Our metal roofs reflect UV rays and
          reduce heat absorption, helping you lower your energy bills year-round.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Extreme Durability:</strong> Enjoy peace of mind with a roof that
          lasts <strong>5 to 10 times longer</strong> than traditional asphalt shingles.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Unmatched Safety:</strong> Metal roofing offers superior protection
          against <strong>fire, high winds, and severe storms</strong>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Weather Resistance:</strong> Heavy-duty metal shingles hold strong
          during Albany’s harshest storms, including hail and strong wind gusts.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Curb Appeal:</strong> Our beautiful stone-coated shingles elevate
          the look of your home with timeless style and texture.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Customer-First Service:</strong> From start to finish, we focus
          on your satisfaction. Our team won’t consider the job done until you’re
          completely happy—and that’s why so many homeowners recommend us!
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-6 leading-relaxed">
        Have questions for our Albany roofing experts? <a
          href="/About/Contact-us"
          class="text-black hover:underline font-bold">Contact Nova Solutions</a
        > today to speak with a knowledgeable team member and schedule your roofing
        consultation.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
<section
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 my-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"
>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black text-center lg:text-left">
      Why Albany Homeowners Trust Nova Solutions for Metal Roofing
    </h2>
    <p class="text-black leading-relaxed text-justify mt-2">
      At Nova Solutions, we’ve successfully designed and installed <strong
        >dozens of high-performance metal roofs</strong
      > across Albany and surrounding areas. Our skilled roofing team brings expert
      knowledge, precision, and care to every project—so you get long-lasting protection
      you can count on.
    </p>
    <p class="text-black leading-relaxed text-justify mt-4">
      We take pride in doing the job right the first time, using proven methods
      and top-quality materials to ensure your new roof stands strong for
      decades. When you work with us, you’re not just getting a metal
      roof—you’re getting peace of mind.
    </p>
    <p class="text-black leading-relaxed text-justify mt-4">
      <strong>Ready to get started?</strong> Call us today at <strong>
        (518)-598-5156</strong
      > for your <strong>free roof inspection and metal roofing estimate</strong
      >. Or simply fill out the quick form on this page. We’re here to help
      bring comfort, style, and strength to your home.
    </p>
  </div>
  <img
    src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyxelzh/image/upload/v1747004020/20230523_183557_x0dx2b.jpg"
    alt="Roofing Installation"
    class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full max-w-lg mx-auto h-85"
  />
</section>

<TrustOur />

<RelationServices title="Related Roofing Services" services={LinkServices} />
<MoreServices />

<Footer />
